OL,3,GNEWSAMan's river death referred to
OL,4,Apolice watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man's death in the River Severn has
OL,7,Fbeen referred to the police watchdog
OL,8,Fafter it is believed police officers
OL,9,Fhad contact with him in the days
OL,10,Fbeforehand.
OL,12,FThe emergency services were called to
OL,13,Fthe river near Worcester Rowing Club at
OL,14,Fabout 08:50 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FOfficers located the man, who was
OL,17,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
