OL,3,GNEWSAMan's river death referred to
OL,4,Apolice watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for West Mercia Police
OL,7,Fsaid formal identification had not yet
OL,8,Ftaken place, adding the force believed
OL,9,Fofficers had contact with the man in
OL,10,Fthe days before his death.
